BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Avatar: Fire and Ash
DTSTART:20251223T231500Z
DTEND:20251224T024500Z
DTSTAMP:20251223T231500Z
UID:IMEbJODF20
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 195 mins (3h15m)\n\nJake and Neytiri's family grappl
 es with grief after Neteyam's death\, encountering a new\, aggressive Na'v
 i tribe\, the Ash People\, who are led by the fiery Varang\, as the confli
 ct on Pandora escalates and a new moral focus emerges. James Cameron takes
  audiences back to Pandora in an immersive new adventure with Marine turne
 d Na’vi leader Jake Sully (Sam Worthington)\, Na’vi warrior Neytiri (Z
 oe Saldaña)\, and the Sully family. All screenings presented in HFR (48fp
 s) 3D.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/avatar-fire-and-ash-3d\n
 \nEstimated start: 15:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
